.Sh TERMS
Definitions in the wording of the published piece.
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Error budget (for an agent)
An agreed allowance for visible failure; hiding a failure is the only breach.
.It Reconciliation loop
Declared state, observe, correct, on every cycle.
For an agent, a per-turn hook checked against a rule file.
.It Separation of duties
The actor and the checker are different parties; for agents, a different
model, a deterministic check or a person.
.It Fail closed / fail open
Stop and report, versus carry on as if nothing happened.
